Key implementation details:
- Duplicate-key YAML loader: 
```python
class DupLoader(yaml.SafeLoader): pass
def _construct_mapping(loader, node, deep=False):
    mapping={}
    dups=[]
    for k,v in node.value:
        key=loader.construct_object(k, deep=deep)
        if key in mapping: dups.append((key, k.start_mark.line+1))
        mapping[key]=loader.construct_object(v, deep=deep)
    loader.dups = getattr(loader,'dups',[]) + dups  # per-file reset
    return mapping
DupLoader.add_constructor(yaml.resolver.BaseResolver.DEFAULT_MAPPING_TAG, _construct_mapping)
```
